  factText: "Ozon (O\u2083) gaz\u0131, atmosferin \xFCst katmanlar\u0131nda G\xFCne\u015F'ten
    gelen zararl\u0131 ultraviyole (UV) \u0131\u015F\u0131nlar\u0131 s\xFCzerek D\xFCnya'daki
